This Chapter will cover the basics of Colonization and System Architecture. How, why, and where to claim systems, an apologetically large amount of data to absorb relatively quickly, and some musings on the logistics of Primary Port construction.

Please note: This chapter is intended to carry you through the construction of your Primary Port and not much further. It is to convey basics, throw stats and charts and information at you, and get you through the initial steps. 

System Architect: The Subtle art of System Design is intended to act as the next stage of this guide, and introduce you into concepts more complicated than “where do I put my first station?”

All of the major information is collated at the end of this chapter, and in the appropriate chapter of Appendix A, which collects all charts and Important Recaps from every chapter.

If you find a term you do not recognize, please do not hesitate to avail yourself of the Glossary, a work in progress where we attempt to list and define important terms and acronyms at play within Elite Dangerous, Trailblazers, and the community at large.
